# Expressions
@scenario tutorial_lesson_03
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide thoughtful]
ginger: If I tell you I'm fine, do you believe me? Watch my face when I say it again.
[show ginger guide embarrassed]
ginger: Oh!
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Replace embarrassed with confused in the second show command. Run the same line again.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: How do you change my reaction in place?
> Show ginger in the same slot with another expression. -> correct
> Declare a new background named confused. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_03]
[flag tutorial_done_03]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
